<title>USA: CUAJONE COPPER OUTPUT NORMAL DESPITE SNOW-ASARCO.</title>
<headline>CUAJONE COPPER OUTPUT NORMAL DESPITE SNOW-ASARCO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operations at Southern Peru Copper Co's Cuajone mine have been unaffected by the heavy snowfall in Peru, according to executives at Asarco Inc, SPCC's majority shareholder.</p>
<p>&quot;All of our operations are completely normal,&quot; a spokeswoman told Reuters. &quot;Production hasn't been affected.&quot;</p>
<p>Cuajone produced 332 million pounds of contained copper in 1996.</p>
<p>((--Derek Caney, New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
